When gaining a combo point, you have a [17%, 36%, 46%, 52%, 56% (TL1-5)] chance to gain an extra combo point. Additionally, every time you earn a combo point, you will regain [0.52, 1.82, 2.60, 3.14, 3.55 (TL1-5)] stamina, or [1.05, 3.63, 5.19, 6.28, 7.10 (TL1-5)] stamina if you would exceed 5 combo points.
